  "question": {
    "text": "The correct statements among <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> to <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> are:<br /><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;Saline hydrides produce <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> gas when reacted with <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>.</mo></math><br /><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;Reaction of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> with <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> leads to <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub></math> .<br /><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> are electron - rich and electron - precise hydrides, respectively.<br /><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> are called as molecular hydrides."
  },
